work/es/java/javase/downloads/index.html).\r\n\r\n*2. Compatibility update - 3rd party current version:* What version of Java SDK? Java SDK 8 or 11?\r\nDetails: The English site lists Oracle JDK 11.0.2 (LTS) as the top recommendation. Does Selenium, Bazel, and everything else work with Java 11? Does it work with the Open JDK 11?\r\n\r\n*3. Compatibility update - different 3rd party:* Continue to link to Oracle JDK or change to Open JDK?\r\nDetails: Should we be pointing people at the Open JDK now as the Oracle JDK’s Oracle Commercial only license will likely scare away contributors (and possibly even team’s considering Angular)? The Open JDK uses a GPL v2 license with the Classpath Exception.\r\n\r\n@IgorMinar: We'll need your input on this. Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/469866323/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jenniferfell","id":31675481,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNjc1NDgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31675481?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell","html_url":"https://github.com/jenniferfell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jenniferfell/received_events","type":"User",